WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:02.820
- I hope I'll just be going
and everyone will be like damn,

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:03.880
what happened to her?

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.799
And I'll be like, I've been Gwyneth-ed.

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:07.966
(ticking)

00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:12.719
So the actress Gwyneth Paltrow
has a lifestyle website

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:13.719
called goop.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.599
- That suggests, usually
very expensive things to do,

00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:21.682
to make your life better.

00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:25.659
So basically, I've created a day

00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:28.819
based off of Gwyneth Paltrow's blogs

00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:31.320
and interviews and recipe books.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.099
How I think she lives her day.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.339
And I'm going to try to emulate that.

00:00:35.339 --> 00:00:38.700
So I'm leaving you today as Chelsea,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.579
but tomorrow I'm gonna be Gwyneth.

00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:43.246
It's gonna be great.

00:00:44.621 --> 00:00:47.939
I'm about to get on the train
to go to the exercise class

00:00:47.939 --> 00:00:50.400
that Gwyneth Paltrow does.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.620
Just got out of the class.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.239
It felt a little cult-ish.

00:00:53.239 --> 00:00:57.239
No one said anything and
everyone just knew what to do.

00:00:57.239 --> 00:00:58.259
It was weird.

00:00:58.259 --> 00:00:59.459
I had a good time.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.709
I'm very tired.

00:01:02.278 --> 00:01:04.639
In the morning, Gwnyeth gives her children

00:01:04.639 --> 00:01:06.839
a little spoonful of flaxseed oil.

00:01:06.839 --> 00:01:11.006
I'm giving my dog-child a
little bit of coconut oil.

00:01:13.419 --> 00:01:15.639
I'm about to make Gwyneth's smoothie.

00:01:15.639 --> 00:01:17.806
I have chosen Action Dust.

00:01:24.419 --> 00:01:27.219
I'm sitting on the floor
so I can lay out my makeup

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:31.039
and chant over it to put
positive energy in it.

00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:34.380
Because that is something that is advised

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.019
by goop and Gwyneth.

00:01:36.019 --> 00:01:37.419
Hm.

00:01:37.419 --> 00:01:39.319
My dog's in the back.

00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:40.339
Bye.

00:01:40.339 --> 00:01:42.439
(lively trumpets and drums)

00:01:42.439 --> 00:01:44.079
I'm gonna tend to my dog-child
then I'm gonna come back,

00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:46.059
read some emails, do some work,

00:01:46.059 --> 00:01:47.800
cook myself some lunch

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.139
and then go to my cupping appointment.

00:01:50.139 --> 00:01:53.056
(relaxation music)

00:01:54.819 --> 00:01:55.759
Hopefully it won't hurt.

00:01:55.759 --> 00:01:56.780
Just got done cupping.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.780
I have intense bruising.

00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:03.899
I've been up since six am,

00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:05.060
I am not a morning person.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.920
But I have so much energy,

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.779
I don't know if it's the
matcha powder in that smoothie,

00:02:09.779 --> 00:02:11.696
maybe it's the cupping.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:14.640
I'm a little tired

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:19.299
and I still have to work
out for one more hour,

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:21.632
make dinner, drink a martini

00:02:23.679 --> 00:02:25.012
and take a bath.

00:02:30.499 --> 00:02:33.319
Got a cigarette, even
though I don't smoke.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.900
Got my drink,

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:37.680
I'm in my bath wearing a
face mask that's tingling

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.179
and I'm exhausted.

00:02:39.179 --> 00:02:42.762
I kinda can't wait to
just be myself again.

00:02:43.699 --> 00:02:46.279
So basically I did a
bunch of glamorous things,

00:02:46.279 --> 00:02:48.679
expensive things, all day.

00:02:48.679 --> 00:02:51.199
And I don't feel any more glamorous.

00:02:51.199 --> 00:02:55.499
I think that the whole idea
of these glamorous lifestyles

00:02:55.499 --> 00:02:57.099
and blogging about it,

00:02:57.099 --> 00:03:00.520
is that you don't see the other
aspect of everyone's life.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:02.299
Like getting to those appointments,

00:03:02.299 --> 00:03:05.159
smelling the garbage on the
street while you're going there,

00:03:05.159 --> 00:03:06.979
and all of those other things.

00:03:06.979 --> 00:03:09.839
And so it's not a good
idea to hold yourself

00:03:09.839 --> 00:03:10.979
up to those standards.

00:03:10.979 --> 00:03:12.639
(frustrated noise)

00:03:12.639 --> 00:03:15.239
But I do like cupping.

00:03:15.239 --> 00:03:16.339
I don't know if I'll do it again,

00:03:16.339 --> 00:03:17.620
but it was cool.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.720
Gwyneth keep doing you,

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.720
I'm gonna keep doing me.

00:03:23.179 --> 00:03:24.659
That's cause that's all we can do.

00:03:24.659 --> 00:03:26.679
(laughing)

00:03:26.679 --> 00:03:29.346
(squeaky noise)

